## The 3-Tier Pricing Ladder

Never give a single price. Give a ladder. The client picks their level of commitment.

| Tier | Name | Price | What's Included | Best For |
|------|------|-------|-----------------|----------|
| **1** | **The Fix** | $100–$300 | Single deliverable, 1 revision, 3-day turnaround | Clients who want to test you |
| **2** | **The Build** | $500–$1,500 | Full project, 2 revisions, 7-day turnaround, 1 follow-up | Clients with a real budget |
| **3** | **The Partnership** | $2,000–$5,000+ | Ongoing retainer, unlimited revisions, priority turnaround, monthly strategy call | Clients who want you embedded |

**Rule:** Always anchor with Tier 2. Most clients will pick Tier 2 if Tier 1 feels too small and Tier 3 feels too big. Tier 1 is your foot in the door. Tier 3 is your upsell 30 days later.

