## The 7-Element Quick Reference Card

Print this. Tape it to your desk. Check every proposal against it before sending.

```
☐ HOOK: Did I lead with the hidden problem? (2 sentences)
☐ DIAGNOSIS: Did I restate the client's words? (3-4 sentences)
☐ MECHANISM: Did I explain HOW in 3 steps? (4-5 sentences)
☐ PROOF: Did I cite one specific result? (2 sentences)
☐ SCOPE: Did I list exact deliverables with deadlines? (5-7 bullets)
☐ PRICE: Did I give one confident number with justification? (1 sentence)
☐ NEXT STEP: Did I ask for a yes/no response? (1 sentence)
```

**If any box is unchecked, the proposal is not ready to send.**

