## The "Foolish For Saying No" Test

Before sending, read the proposal and ask: "If I were the client, would I feel foolish for saying no?"

If the answer is no, the proposal is not ready. Add more revenue context. Sharpen the authority gap. Make the mechanism more specific.

The goal is not to persuade. The goal is to make the decision obvious.

